    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Groq is a Mountain View company founded in 2016 that describes itself as a neocloud for fast inference. Per its site, it offers one fully integrated platform for infrastructure, inference, and control, and the company says millions of developers run trillions of tokens on Groq every week. Its site also states that LPX works alongside NVIDIA's next-generation GPUs to deliver inference capability at scale.\n\nThe site's framing is that of a cloud provider built around inference acceleration rather than model development, and the company presents itself as the premier neocloud for that purpose. No litigation, regulatory filings, or other outside records are part of the material available here, so the profile rests on the company's own description of its platform and scale.",
